# SigmaHQ rules

The replay detector evaluates the SigmaHQ rule set, release
`r2026-07-01` (`sigma_all_rules.zip`, SHA-256 pinned in
`scripts/fetch_datasets.py`), plus the `LICENSE` pointer file at the
release tag. The rules are released under the Detection Rule License
1.1 (https://github.com/SigmaHQ/Detection-Rule-License, SPDX
`DRL-1.1`); only the `rules/windows` subset is evaluated, and only
`status: test` and `status: stable` rules. Corvus is not affiliated
with SigmaHQ. DRL 1.1 requires author attribution in views showing
matches: every Detection Finding carries the Sigma rule author in
`unmapped.sigma_author` and the versioned rule permalink in
`finding_info.src_url`. Rule files and the pinned `LICENSE` live
under git-ignored `data/sigma/` and are never committed.
